  "description": {
    "morphology": "Fronto-central negativity around 150 to 250 ms (measured here at Fz), isolated as the deviant-minus-standard difference wave; its polarity inverts at the mastoids.",
    "meaning": "A pre-attentive, automatic index of auditory deviance detection and echoic sensory memory, often framed as a prediction-error signal. It arises without attention to the sounds.",
    "task": "Auditory oddball paradigms, typically passive (attention directed away from the tones), including roving-standard designs; a marker of auditory discrimination."
  },
